egret it.", "timestamp_created": 1544207877, "timestamp_updated": 1544207877, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47358316", "author": {"steamid": "76561198843991218", "personaname": "ѕαη", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/HRH-Mononoke/", "num_games_owned": 180, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 3811, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 721, "last_played": 1655844433, "avatar": "8e3c0f316f48063e8ad5a2deb9a79238b2ca9a8a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game!", "timestamp_created": 1544195658, "timestamp_updated": 1553862254, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47333570", "author": {"steamid": "76561198311767348", "personaname": "The Big Purple", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WalkingBellend/", "num_games_owned": 257, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1855, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1657, "last_played": 1663876383, "avatar": "56b8e5d6d821d2b92a68ffd4d8d72868495c7d6f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Initially when I started this game I was absolutely horrible, and this resulted in me putting it aside and not really coming back to it. \n\nHowever, the more I played and the more items and characters I unlocked, the game just became better and better. You become completely immersed in this RNG world and its inhabitants, and there is so much to learn about all the playable characters and how to use their abilities with the items at your disposal. (Not to mention the absolute ass-clenching levels where it feels like the next enemy projectile is definitely going to kill you)\n\nIf you're willing to give this game a go and you're willing to just sit past those initial hours where it feels like no progress is being made, I cannot recommend this game enough!", "timestamp_created": 1544135926, "timestamp_updated": 1544135926, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.638128995895385742", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47318538", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004514572", "personaname": "Guy man Hyp", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sswejh/", "num_games_owned": 620, "num_reviews": 152, "playtime_forever": 1765, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1386, "last_played": 1450649020, "avatar": "66662b0f7f869d8d0e058f20aeab1b4e0bb0fb32"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't buy if you want to play co-op it just shuts down every once in a while.. stupid Gamemaker ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥...", "timestamp_created": 1544062858, "timestamp_updated": 1544375423, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.470262646675109863", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}